[en.FOCUS_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP]
Friendship Gone

[en.FOCUS_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP_desc]
Twilight Sparkle and her friends have left Equestria forever, leaving Starlight Glimmer to wander the world alone. Equestria has lost three princesses in three years, with Princess Cadance, the only princess left living and not in prison, but house arrested in the Crystal Empire. The fate of all Equestria suddenly plunged into darkness after the so-called “Jahr Null”...

[zh.FOCUS_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP]
友谊不再

[zh.FOCUS_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP_desc]
暮光闪闪与她的朋友们永远离开了小马利亚，留下星光熠熠在世上踽踽独行。小马利亚三年间失去了三位公主，仅剩下音韵公主被软禁在水晶帝国，全小马利亚的命运在所谓“新元年”后骤然坠入黑暗...\n\n但，生活还得继续。

